Perfect beauty
Everything that you desire in terms of beauty and well-being is now at your disposal.
At least that’s what El Corte Inglés has set out to do, who recently opened a shop with an area of more than 1000 m2 in the shopping center in Callao (Madrid), in which everything revolves around body care.
